WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,580
There's no need to continue the investigation, just leave it at that, miss.

2
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:09,300
Are you giving up? Give up?

3
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:19,180
I have never given up in my life, Master

4
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,340
I just told you to wear more clothes

5
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:27,180
New hundredfold body wave can also catch cold

6
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,620
Who is thinking behind this?

7
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,690
Young Master, it’s almost autumn

8
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,970
It's getting colder here. Please wear more clothes.

9
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:39,370
Don't worry, it'll be there soon

10
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,810
The cars that growled with their bellies stopped.

11
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:44,960
The young master must be laughing at my young master

12
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,520
Those dry foods are not enough

13
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:55,770
You girl are hungry, okay?

14
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,650
If you have the strength again, there is a village

15
00:00:57,930 --> 00:00:59,410
See if you have anything to eat then

16
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:03,460
Then young master, let Ma Zi know quickly.
